    <section class="card set" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <h2 class="card__title" id="about-title">About this prototype</h2>
      <p class="about">Heart rate, SpO₂ and temperature come from the connected wearable when it is present. Blood pressure, glucose, respiration and the ECG-style trace are generated for demonstration because no sensor for them is attached. This is a prototype, not a medical device.</p>
      <p class="card__meta">Alert rules are cautious placeholders: the counts, quality levels and time windows need calibration on the real hardware and clinical review. An alert, or the absence of one, is never medical advice. Inspired by NASA's Human Research Program.</p>
    </section>

    
    <section class="card set demo" id="demo" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
      <h2 class="card__title" id="demo-title">Demo panel</h2>
      <p class="card__meta">For demonstrations. Every change here is written to the audit log.</p>

      <div class="demo__block">
        <h3 class="set__sub">Wearable mode</h3>
        <div class="segmented" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Wearable mode" data-sensor-mode>
          <label class="segmented__item segmented__radio"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="device" checked>Real wearable</label>
          <label class="segmented__item segmented__radio"><input type="radio" name="mode" value="demo">Demo data</label>
        </div>
        <p class="card__meta">Changes only when you switch it here. A wearable going offline never switches it.</p>
        <p class="set__saved" data-saved="mode" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="demo__block">
        <h3 class="set__sub">Judge Mode scenarios</h3>
        <ul class="scenarios">
          
          <li class="scenario">
            <div><p class="scenario__title">Day 142, Mars transit</p><p class="card__meta">Three short nights push the heart rate up and the mood down.</p></div>
            <button class="pill pill--ghost pill--small" type="button" data-scenario="mars_transit"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="/static/vendor/lucide/sprite.svg#play"></use></svg>Run</button>
          </li>
          
          <li class="scenario">
